Dataset-derived files

The files under `artifacts/` and `report/figures/`, except the S-BF and S-BF-EQ
files listed below, are derived from the Tiny-GenImage dataset (Hugging Face:
TheKernel01/Tiny-GenImage, revision 89c4fe9efd0ebc7ce5c7641ef57d578ccd639c69),
which is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike
4.0 International License and is itself built from GenImage (M. Zhu et al.,
"GenImage: A Million-Scale Benchmark for Detecting AI-Generated Image",
NeurIPS 2023).

These derived files (image identities, file names, image hashes, partitions,
per-image scores and predictions, summary tables and figures) are released
under the same license, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Copyright (c) 2026 Ruixin Li. No image from the dataset is included.


S-BF files

The files under `artifacts/supp_bfree/`, `artifacts/predictions/supp_bfree/`,
`artifacts/tables/supp_bfree/`, `report/figures/supp_bfree/`,
`artifacts/supp_bfree_eq/`, `artifacts/predictions/supp_bfree_eq/`,
`artifacts/tables/supp_bfree_eq/` and `report/figures/supp_bfree_eq/`, and
`DATA_CARD_SUPP_BFREE.md`, are derived from the extended Synthbuster set
released with B-Free (https://github.com/grip-unina/B-Free; F. Guillaro et al.,
"A Bias-Free Training Paradigm for More General AI-generated Image Detection",
CVPR 2025). That set contains real photographs from RAISE and synthetic images
generated from captions of those photographs. No image from it is included.

